Copyright notices for the bionic files bundled from the AOSP Android 9 system image
that the image's own NOTICE.txt does not list: linker64 and ld-android.so
(linker.NOTICE), libm.so (libm.NOTICE) and libdl.so (libdl.NOTICE).

Generated from platform/bionic at tag android-9.0.0_r61, the last Android 9 release tag
(the emulator image's build PSR1.210301.009.B6 has no bionic tag of its own), by running
that tag's libc/tools/generate-NOTICE.py (ported to Python 3, output unchanged) on the
linker, libm and libdl directories. scripts/prepare_bionic.sh appends them to the NOTICE
shipped next to the files.
